About us:
As China's economic development enters a new period of high-quality growth, the construction of "One Belt, One Road" also enters a new stage, and a large number of Chinese enterprises with "China's solutions" are heading to the countries where "One Belt, One Road" is being built to find new opportunities in the new blue ocean. A large number of Chinese enterprises with "Chinese solutions" are heading to the "Belt and Road" countries to seek new opportunities in the new blue ocean. 2023 is the 10th anniversary of the "Belt and Road" initiative, and the construction of the "Belt and Road" is an important opportunity under the new global economic model. Against this backdrop, Oriental Seed Securities Co. Ltd. was born.
Oriental Seed Securities Co. Ltd. is a securities financial institution approved by the Malaysian Financial Services Authority. The company is invested by several large Chinese financial institutions with state-owned backgrounds, with strong financial strength, and the company's directors and executives have more than 20 years of experience in the management of China's state-owned financial enterprises.
At present, many Chinese head enterprises are stepping up globalization. The trend of going overseas is unabated, and the demand for fintech going overseas has arisen accordingly. Fintech companies going overseas are more likely to provide solutions or technical capabilities.
As the world's first big data securities financial institution, the core of our business is cutting-edge artificial intelligence (AI) technology. We utilize the power of AI to provide efficient and high-quality financial service packages for the development of companies going overseas.
Oriental Seed Securities has adopted a data-driven approach to data analysis, modeling and model analysis through artificial intelligence (AI) to build a unique business model. Dongzi Securities aims to usher in a new era of financial empowerment and plans to list in the US or Hong Kong in the future.
We are currently looking for Junior Securities Analyst who are fluent in Mandarin Chinese and proficient in Malay and English.
Job content:
1, online collection of analytical articles about China's securities market, and layout and organization;
2、According to the big data software provided by the company, carry out relevant data processing work;
3, the data statistics results, sent to analysts;
4、Present and promote the company's viewpoints on securities analysis in the form of short videos and graphics;
As an Junior Securities Analyst of Dongzi Securities Company, you are required to have:
1, university degree or above;
2、At least three years of work experience;
3、Working experience in securities, banking, insurance and other financial related fields.
Our Advantages
1、Competitive salary; a variety of benefits and subsidies, such as transportation subsidies, organization of staff physical examination, etc;
2、More career advancement opportunities;
3、Good working environment;

